.TH oxiarc-test 1  "oxiarc-test 0.3.6" 
.SH NAME
oxiarc\-test \- Test archive integrity
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBoxiarc\-test\fR [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] <\fIARCHIVE\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Test archive integrity
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
Show verbose output
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.TP
<\fIARCHIVE\fR>
Archive file to test (use "\-" for stdin)
.SH VERSION
v0.3.6
